SUMMARY:Kenya: Individual income tax returns due by end of fourth month
DESCRIPTION:Effective 1 January 2027. From 1 January 2027\, individual taxp
 ayers will be required to file income tax returns by the last day of the f
 ourth month after the end of the year of income.\n\nSource: https://www.kr
 a.go.ke/finance-act-2026-what-it-means-for-you\nDetails: https://www.intel
